00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:09.126
- You've got to stay true to who you are.

00:00:09.126 --> 00:00:09.959
- Be yourself.

00:00:09.959 --> 00:00:11.105
- Stay true to who I am.

00:00:11.105 --> 00:00:14.402
