I'm surprised I've sat
down still this long.

00:03:08.422 --> 00:03:12.195
We've always been a fkn
outcast, and it's kind of cool,

00:03:12.195 --> 00:03:15.794
cause it's really going to
make us great in the future.

00:03:15.794 --> 00:03:17.861
At the end of the day,
throughout all the jokes

00:03:17.861 --> 00:03:20.763
