00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.365
And that's why at the end of the day,

00:03:30.365 --> 00:03:32.872
I'm always going to make
the music I want to make.

00:03:32.872 --> 00:03:37.377
Like people get so caught
up in fkn making their first

00:03:37.377 --> 00:03:40.789
album, like Bastard was pretty successful.

00:03:40.789 --> 00:03:42.809
And people are like,
you should try to make

00:03:42.809 --> 00:03:44.515
