the reason people like us.

00:04:04.612 --> 00:04:05.761
We do what we want.

00:04:05.761 --> 00:04:08.072
- I stayed pretty true to
whatever my instincts are

00:04:08.072 --> 00:04:09.964
as an artist.

00:04:09.964 --> 00:04:12.381
Sometimes for worse at first,

00:04:15.386 --> 00:04:16.219
because I think when you

00:04:16.219 --> 00:04:19.219
do something that's out of the norm,

00:04:21.388 --> 00:04:23.130
you have to keep doing
it for a little while,

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:25.463
to make it your own norm.

00:04:25.463 --> 00:04:27.762
So it's an exciting idea
to me that I could be

00:04:27.762 --> 00:04:32.720
putting a record out and being
able to be my own person.

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:35.332
To not have to think
about what I can't say

00:04:35.332 --> 00:04:39.210
or can't do because I
don't want to lose peoples'

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.309
understanding of what I do
as a convention, you know?

00:04:42.309 --> 00:04:44.078
So I'm really excited about
the idea of people going,

00:04:44.078 --> 00:04:45.634
oh no, that's him.

00:04:45.634 --> 00:04:46.888
That's him, you know.

00:04:46.888 --> 00:04:48.350
- You get new video all the time.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.185
- All the time.

00:04:50.185 --> 00:04:53.622
So this is actually a
