00:05:01.517 --> 00:05:03.665
- Oh my god, yeah.

00:05:03.665 --> 00:05:06.428
- And that's essentially
a commercial for Go Pro.

00:05:06.428 --> 00:05:09.609
- Essentially a commercial for Go Pro.

00:05:09.609 --> 00:05:11.176
It's a marketer's dream.

00:05:11.176 --> 00:05:14.241
And it's all based off
of authenticity, right?

00:05:14.241 --> 00:05:17.109
It's our customers
