00:08:10.783 --> 00:08:12.351
And it was a wonderful school,

00:08:12.351 --> 00:08:14.768
but it was very factory like.

00:08:16.728 --> 00:08:19.026
Not in the Warhol factory like way,

00:08:19.026 --> 00:08:21.419
more like a sausage link factory,

00:08:21.419 --> 00:08:22.252
- Okay.

00:08:22.252 --> 00:08:26.188
- where everyone was taught
the same sorts of things

00:08:26.188 --> 00:08:28.429
