us all to be the same

00:08:31.633 --> 00:08:33.537
and possess the same skills.

00:08:33.537 --> 00:08:38.309
And I had something very
different inside of me.

00:08:38.309 --> 00:08:40.643
- You think the secret to
your success is actually

00:08:40.643 --> 00:08:43.545
